{"nodes": [{"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_figure", "label": "The Spectra Index \u2014 \u039b_spectra (Rydberg channel lattice)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A pickable 3D lattice of every Rydberg channel the structure admits, on (Z, ionisation stage, \u2113), where the click target is a single channel's quantum defect and its provenance."}, {"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_rydberg_channel", "label": "Rydberg channel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One cell of this index: an (element, core charge, \u2113) channel. 624 channels admitted."}, {"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_closed_index_624", "label": "Closed index: |X| = |\u211b(X)| = 624, E = 0", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The complete index is closed; what is missing is collection, not structure \u2014 E(collected) = 423 while E(structure) = 0."}, {"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_quantum_defect", "label": "Quantum defect \u03b4", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The value each channel carries: a single number when measured, an interval lo\u2013hi when only bracketed."}, {"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_status_measured", "label": "Status: measured (313)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Channels with a \u03b4 read from data; 313 of 624, about half the lattice."}, {"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_status_bracketed_two_sided", "label": "Status: bracketed, two-sided", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u03b4 known only within an interval bounded from both sides, with the witness channel named in the 'from' field."}, {"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_status_bracketed_one_sided", "label": "Status: bracketed, one-sided", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u03b4 bounded from one side only \u2014 weaker than two-sided, and coloured differently so the difference is visible."}, {"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_status_exists_unmeasured", "label": "Status: exists, unmeasured", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drawn as a small translucent cube and not pickable: the channel is admitted by the structure but no value stands for it."}, {"id": "extracted_archives_restore_point_2_13_spectra_lattice_e_collected_423", "label": "E(collected) = 423", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "extracted/archives/restore-point-2-13/spectra-lattice.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at":